                <pb facs="0417" n="329" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3126: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Feely</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-20T15:00:00-04:00">May 20, 1933—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>15. Your 48, May 19, 8 p.m. Has Bolivian Government also replied to Chilean note?
                    Chilean Government will not cooperate either unless it gets a satisfactory
                    answer.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
